OL,3,GNEWSANine police staff face action over
OL,4,Adomestic murder
OL,5,
OL,6,FNine police staff from two forces will
OL,7,Fface action following an investigation
OL,8,Finto their interaction with a woman
OL,9,Fbefore she was killed by her
OL,10,Fex-partner.
OL,12,FThe Independent Office for Police
OL,13,FConduct (IOPC) found Tara Kershaw, from
OL,14,FGreat Yarmouth, Norfolk, had called
OL,15,FNorfolk Police on six occasions between
OL,16,FNovember 2023 and January 2024,
OL,17,Fincluding the day before she was killed
OL,18,Fby ex-partner Adam Barnard.
OL,20,FThe IOPC said five members of staff
OL,21,Fwould face disciplinary hearings while
OL,22,Ffour must undertake a practice review.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,377,370,200,160,0,100
